WEBVTT

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.976
kwamba vijana wadogo wa Kiamerika 
walikuwa wauaji waliokubuhu.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:06.976
(Kicheko)

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:12.976
(Makofi)

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.976
Sasa, kiukweli nilisema hili 
kutokana na kukerwa.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.976
(Kicheko)

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:20.191
Lakini isingeweza kutokea kwangu kuwaza

00:11:20.215 --> 00:11:23.976
kwamba kwa sababu nimesoma riwaya 
ambayo muhusika ni muuaji wa kufululiza

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.976
kwamba kwa kiasi fulani 
wanawakilisha Wamarekani wote.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.976
Hii si kwamba mimi 
ni mtu bora kuliko yule mwanafunzi,